# Environment files.
#
# .env WAS TRACKED in this repo until Oct 2026 (commit c3fe336). What it held was
# publishable-by-design - Stripe pk_live_, the Supabase anon key - so nothing
# leaked, but it was a trap: the next person to add a real secret would have
# pushed it to GitHub. Acuity credentials were nearly put there.
#
# Server-side secrets (ACUITY_API_KEY, Stripe secret, service-role keys) belong
# in Supabase Edge Function secrets, never in a file in this repo.
#
# Copy .env.example to .env to get a working local setup.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
